iv class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"72.7\" width=\"320\" height=\"24.5\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,69.1 9.1,58.2 14.2,77.3 19.3,70.1 24.5,50.8 29.6,77.5 34.7,71.4 39.8,69.0 44.9,57.0 50.0,67.0 55.1,81.2 60.3,83.6 65.4,70.6 70.5,53.0 75.6,35.8 80.7,43.1 85.8,46.1 91.0,53.2 96.1,30.3 101.2,65.7 106.3,77.8 111.4,57.3 116.5,64.7 121.6,67.4 126.8,64.3 131.9,64.3 137.0,51.3 142.1,43.1 147.2,16.2 152.3,12.8 157.4,24.3 162.6,44.8 167.7,43.2 172.8,33.1 177.9,26.3 183.0,37.4 188.1,42.5 193.2,61.9 198.4,62.6 203.5,49.1 208.6,52.3 213.7,50.3 218.8,59.7 223.9,46.2 229.0,46.2 234.2,53.9 239.3,47.8 244.4,49.1 249.5,50.6 254.6,52.2 259.7,60.0 264.9,48.8 270.0,44.1 275.1,49.5 280.2,64.4 285.3,64.0 290.4,47.5 295.5,74.3 300.7,69.7 305.8,66.6 310.9,70.4 316.0,69.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 81.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 81.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 19.3 82.1 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 55.1 93.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 106.3 89.8 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 137.0 63.3 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 254.6 64.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 280.2 76.4 l 5 8 l -10